<Behavior #explainable-inference apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" (
  <Requirements [
    <Requirement #finite-explainable-inference (
      <Statement ?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPV>
      推理 SHALL 在冻结 epoch 内求有限关系固定点，保存每次推导的 rule、直接 premises、conclusion 与缺席证据；预算耗尽不能报告 complete。
      </?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPV>
      <Suites [
        <Suite #supports { name = "支持图" } (
          <Cases [
            <Case #cycle-and-multiple-causes (
              <Given ?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPW>
              有环依赖、多个根因与多前提规则
              </?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPW>
              <When ?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPX>
              执行真实 Cozo 推理并查询解释
              </?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPX>
              <Then ?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPY>
              固定点终止，保留多条支持路径与每组完整前提；新 epoch 移除根因后旧推导不残留。
              </?01M1W294SGT598S2MV4MTS8YPY>
            )>
          ]>
        )>
      ]>
    )>
  ]>
)>
